      "account_name": "えふらぶ@FXトレーダー",
      "bookmarks": 14,
      "content_en": "Out of the blue, my HFM account was just suspended... I'm still checking the details, but it's probably because of 'Flove Gold Gap Up Trading'. XM only gave a warning, but HFM suddenly banned the account... all accounts, including the copy-trade strategy account, were closed and the funds were moved to the wallet. I had also started preparing for the recently released XAUUSD247 and had assumed I would provide other signals too, so it's just disappointing. To everyone using EAs / copy trading on HFM, I'm truly sorry. What to do with 'Flove Gold Gap Up Trading' from now on is still undecided at this point. Having been shut out of both XM and HFM, I feel it would be hard to simply keep running it at another broker, though...",
      "content_original": "突然ですが先程HFMのアカウントが停止になりました・・・\n\n具体的にはまだ確認中ですが、多分「Flove Gold Gap Up Trading」が原因だと思います。XMは警告で済んだのにHFMはいきなり垢バン・・・コピートレードのストラテジー口座を含め全口座閉鎖されてウォレットに資金移動されてました。\n\n最近出てきたXAUUSD247への対応準備も始めていて、他にもシグナル提供する想定はしてただけにただただ残念です。\n\nHFMでEA・コピトレをご利用の皆様、本当に申し訳ございません。今後「Flove Gold Gap Up Trading」をどうするかは現時点でまだ未定です。XMとHFMから締め出された以上、そのまま他社で運用するのは厳しい気がしますが・・・",
