      "content_en": "FX diary, 19 Sep 2026. Fintokei Quartz Step 1: 1,001,979 -> 1,007,183 yen. AXIORY [principal 0 yen]: 13,167 -> 12,977 yen. XM [principal 10,000 yen]: 13,176 -> 10,724 yen. Real accounts total: 67,899 -> 65,257 yen. Prop total: -60,931 yen. FX 2026 total: +6,968 -> +4,326 yen. I carried over an AUD/NZD short and have nothing but worry, but it feels like it's about time for a top, so even if my current position gets burned I think I'd go in again. Gold was rampaging but ended in the plus. For floating losses I just endure with 0.01 lot, and for floating profits I want to actively pyramid. Prop accounts alive/purchased: 1/16. Total expenses: -559,750 yen. Total withdrawals: +498,819 yen. Net P/L: -60,931 yen. FX lifetime total: about -5,000,000 yen; about 105,000,000 yen more to the goal of 100,000,000 yen.",
